Only needed if zKillboard uses its EXISTING donation character ($adminCharacter) as the
bounty receiving character. Without it, cron/9.wallet.php would also turn a bounty deposit
into ad-free months (double use of the same ISK). With a dedicated bounty character, skip this.
Diff against zKillboard/zKillboard@c39f299 (2026-11-17).

--- a/cron/9.wallet.php
